{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "elements": [{"id": "e1", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": -60, "width": 771.6800000000001, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 258383903, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 459925154, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "05 · Админка: заявки, часы работы и закрытия (/admin)", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 26, "containerId": null, "originalText": "05 · Админка: заявки, часы работы и закрытия (/admin)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e2", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 900, "height": 1000, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 78512828, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 228373932, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 940, "y": 0, "width": 380, "height": 1000, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 718840244, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 325107628, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e4", "type": "text", "x": 956, "y": 12, "width": 241.92000000000002, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 841744892, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 131372186, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Поля из базы на этом экране", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 16, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Поля из базы на этом экране", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e5", "type": "text", "x": 956, "y": 44, "width": 364.00000000000006, "height": 406.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1d4ed8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 963174800, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 834225021, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Заявки (GET /admin/bookings?status=PENDING):\nusers.name — клиент\nvenues.name — площадка\nbookings.start_at, end_at — время\nbookings.total_price — цена\nbookings.status — статус\nbookings.comment — комментарий клиента\nbookings.created_at — когда подана, осталось ждать\nСчётчик «Заявки (3)»: GET /admin/stats\n  → pending_count\n\n«Подтвердить» → PATCH /admin/bookings/:id/confirm\n«Отклонить» → PATCH /admin/bookings/:id/reject\n  причина обязательна:\n  booking_status_history.reason\n  без причины кнопка «Отклонить» выключена\n\nЧасы работы: working_hours.day_of_week,\n  open_time, close_time (нет строки = выходной)\n  PUT /admin/venues/:id/working-hours\n\nЗакрытия: closures.date, closures.reason\n  POST /admin/venues/:id/closures\n  409 «Есть подтверждённые брони» (БП9)\n  DELETE /admin/closures/:id", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Заявки (GET /admin/bookings?status=PENDING):\nusers.name — клиент\nvenues.name — площадка\nbookings.start_at, end_at — время\nbookings.total_price — цена\nbookings.status — статус\nbookings.comment — комментарий клиента\nbookings.created_at — когда подана, осталось ждать\nСчётчик «Заявки (3)»: GET /admin/stats\n  → pending_count\n\n«Подтвердить» → PATCH /admin/bookings/:id/confirm\n«Отклонить» → PATCH /admin/bookings/:id/reject\n  причина обязательна:\n  booking_status_history.reason\n  без причины кнопка «Отклонить» выключена\n\nЧасы работы: working_hours.day_of_week,\n  open_time, close_time (нет строки = выходной)\n  PUT /admin/venues/:id/working-hours\n\nЗакрытия: closures.date, closures.reason\n  POST /admin/venues/:id/closures\n  409 «Есть подтверждённые брони» (БП9)\n  DELETE /admin/closures/:id", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e6", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 900, "height": 50, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 165835799, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 768927868, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e7", "type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 15, "width": 100.80000000000001, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 690907762, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 708945036, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SportBook", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 20, "containerId": null, "originalText": "SportBook", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e8", "type": "text", "x": 560, "y": 17, "width": 39.2, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", 